{"sha": "9a7948c6624d6583f9bd17a9e6995bbdb48bb1bba6285fc69750e1800184e127", "body": ["\\begin{method}[是否芳香？]\\label{met:b2:huckel:aromaticity}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 体系是否为环，且每个原子上都有一个 p 轨道（计入碳正离子", "        和碳负离子中心，以及杂原子上的孤电子对）？", "  \\item 它能否为平面结构？", "  \\item 数一数 $\\pi$ 电子的个数：若为平面结构，则 $4N + 2$ 为芳香性，$4N$ 为反芳香性。", "  \\item 若可能，反芳香性环应避免平面化或共轭", "        （环辛四烯呈盆形，其行为与多烯相似）。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[苯]\\label{ex:b2:huckel:benzene}", "六个 $\\pi$ 电子填入 $\\alpha + 2\\beta$ 能级及 $\\alpha + \\beta$ 能级对：$E_\\pi = 6\\alpha + 8\\beta$。", "三个孤立双键给出 $6\\alpha + 6\\beta$：离域能为 $2\\beta$，", "约为六碳开链己三烯（$0.988\\beta$）的两倍：", "闭环所带来的稳定化与之相当。由对称性，所有键级相等（$p = 2/3$），六个键长", "亦相等，均为 \\qty{139.7}{pm}，介于乙烯（\\qty{133.9}{pm}）与乙烷", "（\\qty{153.6}{pm}）之间。", "% ledger: geo:C6H6.rCC, geo:C2H4.rCC, geo:C2H6.rCC", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, y=0.013cm, x=1.0cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (10.5,0);", "  \\node[anchor=north] at (5.2,-8) {环己烷（$\\Delta_r H = 0$ 参考）};", "  % cyclohexene", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] (0.6,118.8) -- (1.6,118.8); \\draw[->, omDef] (1.1,118.8) -- (1.1,4);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south, align=center] at (1.1,120) {环己烯\\\\ \\qty{118.8}{kJ/mol}};", "  % diene", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] (3.6,227.7) -- (4.6,227.7); \\draw[->, omDef] (4.1,227.7) -- (4.1,4);", "  \\draw[thick, black!45, densely dashed] (4.7,237.6) -- (5.6,237.6);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south, black!60] at (5.15,240) {$2 \\times 118.8$};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=east, align=right] at (3.5,227.7) {1,3-环己二烯\\\\ \\qty{227.7}{kJ/mol}};", "  % benzene", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] (7.6,206.0) -- (8.6,206.0); \\draw[->, omDef] (8.1,206.0) -- (8.1,4);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=east, align=right] at (7.5,206.0) {苯\\\\ \\qty{206.0}{kJ/mol}};", "  \\draw[thick, black!45, densely dashed] (7.6,356.4) -- (8.6,356.4);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south, black!60] at (8.1,358) {$3 \\times 118.8 = 356.4$};", "  \\draw[<->, omThm, thick] (8.9,206) -- (8.9,356.4) node[midway, right, font=\\scriptsize] {\\qty{150}{kJ/mol}};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 气相中催化氢化生成环己烷的焓变，由列表中的生成焓求得", "（柱高表示放出的热量）。两个共轭双键", "放出的热量比两倍单个双键少 \\qty{10}{kJ/mol}；苯放出的热量比三倍单个双键少", "\\qty{150}{kJ/mol}，这便是其芳香稳定化。}", "% ledger: dfh:C6H6_g, dfh:C6H10_g, dfh:C6H12_g, dfh:C6H8_g", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{history}[凯库勒的环]", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.22\\linewidth}", "\\vspace{0pt}", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth]{images/book3/kekule.jpg}", "\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.74\\linewidth}", "\\vspace{0pt}", "1865 年，凯库勒提出苯的六个碳原子构成一个环，", "单键与双键交替排列，且很快认为这两种交替极速互换，", "以致每个键都完全相同。以 X 射线衍射", "测得的等长键与铺展于整个环上的 $\\pi$ 轨道，使他的直觉获得了现代形式；", "1931 年，休克尔规则解释了为何六个电子（而非四个或", "八个）能使环具有特殊性。（肖像，1873 年，作者不详，公有领域，", "取自维基共享资源。）", "\\end{minipage}", "\\end{history}", "", "\\section{共轭体系与光}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[多烯的能隙]\\label{prop:b2:huckel:gap}", "对线性多烯，设其碳原子数为 $n$（$n$ 为偶数），则", "最高占据与最低空 $\\pi$ 能级之间的能隙为 $4|\\beta|\\sin(\\pi/(2(n + 1)))$：它随", "链长增加而减小。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "最高占据能级为 $k = n/2$，最低空能级为 $k = n/2 + 1$。记 $\\theta_k =", "k\\pi/(n + 1)$，则 $E_{n/2+1} - E_{n/2} = 2|\\beta|(\\cos\\theta_{n/2} - \\cos\\theta_{n/2+1}) = 4|\\beta|", "\\sin\\frac{\\theta_{n/2} + \\theta_{n/2+1}}{2}\\sin\\frac{\\theta_{n/2+1} - \\theta_{n/2}}{2}$，而第一个正弦", "为 $\\sin(\\pi/2) = 1$。它随 $n$ 增大而减小，因 $\\sin$ 在", "$[0, \\pi/2]$ 上递增。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.5\\linewidth, height=5cm, xmin=0, xmax=22, ymin=0, ymax=2.2,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={碳原子数 $n$}, ylabel={能隙$/|\\beta|$},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omThm, thick, mark=*, mark size=1.3pt] table[x=n, y=gap] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-huckel-b.dat};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}\\hfill", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.48\\linewidth, height=5.4cm, xmin=-1, xmax=11, ymin=-2.4, ymax=2.4,", "  axis x line=none, axis y line=left, ylabel={$(E - \\alpha)/|\\beta|$}, clip=false,", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[only marks, mark=-, mark size=5pt, very thick, omDef] table[x=x, y=e] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-huckel-a.dat};", "\\draw[densely dotted] (axis cs:-1,0) -- (axis cs:11,0);", "\\node[anchor=north, font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:0,-2.45) {C$_2$};", "\\node[anchor=north, font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:2,-2.45) {C$_3$};", "\\node[anchor=north, font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:4,-2.45) {C$_4$};", "\\node[anchor=north, font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:6,-2.45) {C$_6$};", "\\node[anchor=north, font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:8,-2.45) {四元环};", "\\node[anchor=north, font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:10,-2.45) {六元环};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左图：线性多烯的休克尔能隙随链长增加而减小，这正是长共轭链", "吸收波长更长的光、乃至可见光的原因。", "右图：乙烯、烯丙基、丁二烯、己三烯（链状）以及", "环丁二烯、苯（环状）的计算能级；成键能级位于 $\\alpha$ 以下。}", "\\end{omfigure}", ""]}